# NeoDev MVP Documents

Controlled documents in `prd/`, `prototype/`, and `tech-design/` must use YAML front matter accepted by NeoDev scan and validation.

Required front matter:

```yaml
doc_id: DOC-001
title: Document Title
doc_type: prd
product_key: PRODUCT
status: draft
relations:
  target:
    - TARGET-DOC-001
```

Allowed `doc_type` values are `prd`, `prototype`, and `tech-design`.

Allowed `status` values are `draft`, `active`, and `deprecated`.

`relations.target` must be a non-empty list of non-empty strings. Extra fields are allowed, but missing required fields block `doc scan` and `doc change register`.

Validate before scan or registration:

```bash
python plugins/neodev-rd-knowledge/validate_mvp_docs.py prd prototype tech-design
```
